Prerequisites:
1. Download and install virtual box
2. Download and install vagrant

Step 1:
Clone the repository https://github.com/kodekloudhub/certified-kubernetes-administrator-course
   << git clone https://github.com/kodekloudhub/certified-kubernetes-administrator-course.git >>

Step 2:
go to path kubeadm-clusters/virtualbox/Vagrantfile and view the file for vagrant configuration
<< vi Vagrantfile>>

Step 3:
check the status of virtual machines using below command
<< vagrant status >>

Step 4:
Bring up the VM's as specified in vagrantfile using below command
<< vagrant up >>

Step 5:
Connect to any vm using below command
<< vagrant ssh kubemaster >>



